<main class="admin-shell dr-page"><div class="container dr-container"><header class="dr-heading"><div><h1>Fee change requests</h1><p>Review consultation fees proposed by clinic main physicians.</p></div><a class="btn btn-outline" href="clinics.php">Back to clinics</a></header>
<?php if($flash): ?><p class="form-message success" role="status"><?= htmlspecialchars($flash) ?></p><?php endif; ?><?php foreach($errors as $error): ?><p class="form-message error" role="alert"><?= htmlspecialchars($error) ?></p><?php endforeach; ?>
<section class="dr-panel"><p>Approved changes apply to new bookings from their effective date. Existing bookings keep their original fee. Revenue shares use the actual payment.</p>
